OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEvening rain
OL,6,Fover Shetland, otherwise it will be
OL,7,Fdry with clear spells. A further rain
OL,8,Fband will push east across the
OL,9,FNorthern Isles towards morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain at times
OL,12,Ffirst thing during the morning. The
OL,13,Frain and cloud clear east, leaving the
OL,14,Fthe rest of the day dry with sunny
OL,15,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
